WEBVTT

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.828
Match Review uses
the published Teams selection.

00:00:05.828 --> 00:00:09.681
Check the match. Its date
and opposition stay together.

00:00:09.681 --> 00:00:15.336
Choose a selected player
to add your observation.

00:00:15.336 --> 00:00:20.582
Choose your view of the innings.
Assess the dismissal separately.

00:00:20.582 --> 00:00:25.736
Record what you noticed.
Keep it useful and specific.

00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:27.690
Save the observation.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:32.063
Back at the same match.
Choose another player when ready.
